#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Classify a dataset {#classify-a-dataset}"
msgstr "Klasifikasikan dataset {#classify-a-dataset}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In this example, you'll use the \"Singularity Machine Learning - Classification\" function to classify a dataset consisting of two interleaving, moon-shaped half-circles. The dataset is synthetic, two-dimensional, and labeled with binary labels. It is created to be challenging for algorithms such as centroid-based clustering and linear classification.\n"
"![Moons dataset](/docs/images/guides/multiverse-computing-singularity/moon_shaped.avif)\n"
"Through this process, you'll learn how to create the classifier, fit it to the training data, use it to predict on the test data, and delete the classifier when you're finished.\n"
"Before starting, you need to install [scikit-learn](https://scikit-learn.org/). Install it using the following command:\n"
msgstr ""
"Dalam contoh ini, anda akan menggunakan fungsi \"Singularity Machine Learning - Classification\" untuk mengklasifikasikan dataset yang terdiri daripada dua separuh bulatan berbentuk bulan yang saling bersilang. Dataset ini adalah sintetik, dua dimensi, dan dilabelkan dengan label binari. Ia dicipta untuk mencabar algoritma seperti pengelompokan berasaskan centroid dan klasifikasi linear.\n"
"![Dataset Moons](/docs/images/guides/multiverse-computing-singularity/moon_shaped.avif)\n"
"Melalui proses ini, anda akan belajar cara mencipta pengelas, memasangkannya pada data latihan, menggunakannya untuk membuat ramalan pada data ujian, dan menghapus pengelas apabila selesai.\n"
"Sebelum memulakan, anda perlu memasang [scikit-learn](https://scikit-learn.org/). Pasangnya menggunakan arahan berikut:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Perform the following steps:\n"
msgstr "Laksanakan langkah-langkah berikut:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1) '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create the synthetic dataset using the [`make_moons`](https://scikit-learn.org/stable/modules/generated/sklearn.datasets.make_moons.html) function from [scikit-learn](https://scikit-learn.org/).\n"
msgstr "Cipta dataset sintetik menggunakan fungsi [`make_moons`](https://scikit-learn.org/stable/modules/generated/sklearn.datasets.make_moons.html) daripada [scikit-learn](https://scikit-learn.org/).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2) '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Upload the generated synthetic dataset to the [shared data directory](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-serverless/function_features/experimental/manage_data_directory.html).\n"
msgstr "Muat naik dataset sintetik yang dijana ke [direktori data bersama](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-serverless/function_features/experimental/manage_data_directory.html).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3) '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create the quantum-enhanced classifier using the [`create`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/multiverse-computing-singularity#create) action.\n"
msgstr "Cipta pengelas yang dipertingkatkan kuantum menggunakan tindakan [`create`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/multiverse-computing-singularity#create).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '4) '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Enlist your classifiers using the [`list`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/multiverse-computing-singularity#list) action.\n"
msgstr "Senaraikan pengelas anda menggunakan tindakan [`list`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/multiverse-computing-singularity#list).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '5) '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Train the classifier on the train data using the [`fit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/multiverse-computing-singularity#fit) action.\n"
msgstr "Latih pengelas pada data latihan menggunakan tindakan [`fit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/multiverse-computing-singularity#fit).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '6) '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the trained classifier to predict on the test data using the [`predict`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/multiverse-computing-singularity#predict) action.\n"
msgstr "Gunakan pengelas yang telah dilatih untuk membuat ramalan pada data ujian menggunakan tindakan [`predict`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/multiverse-computing-singularity#predict).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '7) '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Delete the classifier using the [`delete`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/multiverse-computing-singularity#delete) action.\n"
msgstr "Hapuskan pengelas menggunakan tindakan [`delete`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/multiverse-computing-singularity#delete).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"8) Clean up after you're done.\n"
"**Step 1.** Import the necessary modules and generate the synthetic dataset, then split it into training and test datasets.\n"
msgstr ""
"8) Bersihkan setelah selesai.\n"
"**Langkah 1.** Import modul yang diperlukan dan jana dataset sintetik, kemudian bahagikannya kepada dataset latihan dan ujian.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Step 2.** Save the labeled training and test datasets on your local disk, and then upload them to the [shared data directory](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-serverless/function_features/experimental/manage_data_directory.html).\n"
msgstr "**Langkah 2.** Simpan dataset latihan dan ujian berlabel pada cakera tempatan anda, kemudian muat naiknya ke [direktori data bersama](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-serverless/function_features/experimental/manage_data_directory.html).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Step 3.** Create a quantum-enhanced classifier using the [`create`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/multiverse-computing-singularity#create) action.\n"
msgstr "**Langkah 3.** Cipta pengelas yang dipertingkatkan kuantum menggunakan tindakan [`create`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/multiverse-computing-singularity#create).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Step 4.** Train the quantum-enhanced classifier using the [`fit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/multiverse-computing-singularity#fit) action.\n"
msgstr "**Langkah 4.** Latih pengelas yang dipertingkatkan kuantum menggunakan tindakan [`fit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/multiverse-computing-singularity#fit).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Step 5.** Obtain predictions and probabilities from the quantum-enhanced classifier using the [`predict`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/multiverse-computing-singularity#predict) action.\n"
msgstr "**Langkah 5.** Dapatkan ramalan dan kebarangkalian daripada pengelas yang dipertingkatkan kuantum menggunakan tindakan [`predict`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/multiverse-computing-singularity#predict).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Step 6.** Delete the quantum-enhanced classifier using the [`delete`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/multiverse-computing-singularity#delete) action.\n"
msgstr "**Langkah 6.** Hapuskan pengelas yang dipertingkatkan kuantum menggunakan tindakan [`delete`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/multiverse-computing-singularity#delete).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Step 7.** Clean up local and shared data directories.\n"
msgstr "**Langkah 7.** Bersihkan direktori data tempatan dan bersama.\n"

